  "body": "Beautifully renovated while preserving its timeless 1920s character, this elevated, north-facing transition bungalow on sought-after Aramoana Avenue delivers an exceptional blend of charm, contemporary comfort and relaxed family living.\r\n\r\nBathed in all-day sun and enjoying sweeping outlooks, the home welcomes you across a generous front lawn and covered veranda into warm, beautifully presented interiors arranged over two levels.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, three bedrooms are complemented by a family bathroom and a stylishly renovated kitchen at the heart of the home. Open-plan living and dining flow seamlessly into the spacious lounge, where expansive north-facing windows capture the sun and frame views across the pool terrace and beyond.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, the private master suite provides a peaceful retreat, complete with ensuite and views to the pool. A versatile pool room and separate laundry add further practicality and flexibility for family life.\r\n\r\nOutside, the sun-soaked swimming pool and private entertaining terrace create an inviting setting for long summer days, relaxed gatherings with friends and effortless family enjoyment\r\n\r\nPositioned on a corner site, the property offers excellent dual access - through the front gate or via the large double garage with automated door and generous storage - adding further convenience to this impressive family home.\r\n\r\nThe location is equally appealing. Public transport provides easy access to Takapuna, Devonport Village and the CBD ferry, while excellent junior, intermediate and secondary schools are within walking distance. Sports fields, Waitemata Golf Club, beautiful Narrow Neck Beach and the active Wakatere Boating Club are also close at hand, placing an enviable range of recreation and lifestyle amenities on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nCombining enduring character with contemporary comfort in a premium Devonport location, this is a wonderful family home with superb indoor-outdoor flow and a lifestyle to match. Simply move in, settle back and enjoy - all the hard work has been done.",
